      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563138071,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1  No route\nContainer 1 has no path to a container on another\nhost: docker0 is local to each machine.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b18",
      "originalText": "1  No route\nContainer 1 has no path to a container on another host: docker0 is local to each machine.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pmrkGIlnGghIAP9ZdM_76",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 442.80853271484375,
      "y": 462.25,
      "width": 406.3829345703125,
      "height": 37.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 584713969,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1490196831,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563138071,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2  Same addresses\nBoth containers may be 172.17.0.2. Which one is meant?",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b19",
      "originalText": "2  Same addresses\nBoth containers may be 172.17.0.2. Which one is meant?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QKwRrclv4_84gEP0XRVnn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 898.1962127685547,
      "y": 452.875,
      "width": 367.6075744628906,
      "height": 56.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1153302737,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1178955793,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563138071,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3  Hidden behind NAT\nEach container sits behind its own host's NAT, so\nnobody can start a connection to it.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b20",
      "originalText": "3  Hidden behind NAT\nEach container sits behind its own host's NAT, so nobody can start a connection to it.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8dza4Ydh9XUejIHmN627H",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 139.55712890625,
      "y": 589.375,
      "width": 1010.8857421875,
      "height": 21.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1606926001,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1058411903,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563138071,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We want containers on different hosts to talk as if they were on ONE switch. That is what an overlay network provides.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b21",
      "originalText": "We want containers on different hosts to talk as if they were on ONE switch. That is what an overlay network provides.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
